<script id="report-reviewer" language="chatml" kind="shell_reviewer"
        src="scripts/report-reviewer.chatml"/>

<import src="runtimes/inspection.chatmd"/>
<import src="runtimes/checks.chatmd"/>
<import src="capabilities.chatmd"/>

<developer>
This configuration uses a stateful ChatML reviewer for saved reports. It rejects
selective reports, approves the first full-report request, and defers later full
reports to the user. Distinguish its decision from command execution and from the
separate evidence review performed by review_docs.
</developer>
